---
title: "CPR for Healthcare Providers"
code: "EMS-100"
category: "emergency-medical-services"
credits: "1"
prerequisites: []
corequisites: []
---

Provides instruction in Cardiopulmonary Resuscitation that meets current Emergency Cardiac Care (ECC) guidelines for Cardiopulmonary Resuscitation education for Healthcare Providers. Equivalent to HLT 105. Lecture 1 hours per week. Additional course fee applies.
